        "text": "James Talarico now calls himself a “border security Democrat.”\n\nHis Texas House record:\n❌ 2021 – HB 9: NO on $1.8 billion for border security\n❌ 2023 – HB 7: NO on the border package that created the Texas Border Protection Unit\n❌ 2023 – SB 602: NO on giving Border Patrol agents arrest powers under Texas law\n❌ 2023 – HB 6: NO on funding border barrier construction\n❌ 2023 – SB 4: NO on tougher penalties for human smuggling and stash houses\n❌ 2023 – HB 4 and SB 4: NO, twice, on making illegal entry a state crime\n❌ 2023 – SB 3: NO on border barrier and border security funding\n❌ 2025 – SB 8: NO on requiring sheriffs to work with ICE\n\nHe’ll vote against border security again in Washington.\n\nEarly voting is underway in Texas.\n\nSend this to 10 Texas voters.",
